00:16:35.540 --> 00:16:46.190
<v Ira Glass>I mean you can see why they would get so worked up about this. They had been working every day for two months, which actually brings us to one of the difficult things about doing theater, especially a show like Riverdance.
<v Ira Glass>我是说你能看出他们为什么会对这个如此兴奋。他们两个月来每天都在工作，这实际上带出了做剧场，特别是像《大河之舞》这样的演出的困难点之一。

00:16:46.190 --> 00:17:07.350
<v Katie Else>You have to find ways to break up the monotony of doing something like that. Because it's not even like you have a role to throw yourself into. And half of what I sing is nonsense anyway. So to have something else to add to the show or spice up the show I think helps a lot. Because otherwise, you can just easily just be going through the motions.
